title: Labor Affairs
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: govt_affairs, cabinet
on-arrival: labor_affairs_timer = 6; month_actions += 1; labor_affairs_seen = 1
view-if: psoe_in_government = 1 and labor_minister_party = "PSOE" and labor_affairs_timer = 0 and strike_term_seen = 0 and jurados_mixtos >= 1
card-image: img/hombrelibre.jpg
#subtitle: Addressing labor unrest and strikes.

= Labor Affairs

Agrarian regions [? if jurados_mixtos >= 2 : and industrial hubs ?] are experiencing fierce labor unrest. With our Mixed Juries established, employers and union representatives must sit at the same table to arbitrate wages, workday limits and working conditions in general. As the Ministry of Labor, we hold the decisive vote in resolving these disputes.

- @support_labor: Support labor in their demands.
- @support_employers: Support the employers in their demands.
- @balance: Try to strike a compromise between the sides.
- @easy_discard
#- @cancel_advisor_action

@support_labor
subtitle: Popular among the workers, this will alienate the bourgeoisie.
on-arrival: besteiristas_strength += 5; besteiristas_dissent -= 5; caballeristas_dissent -= 5; workers_psoe += 6*(1-dissent) if jurados_mixtos >= 2; rural_psoe += 6*(1-dissent); coalition_dissent += 1 if in_republican_socialist_conjunction == 1; prr_relation -= 4; capital_strike_progress += 1 if prr_relation <= 30; capital_strike_progress += 1 if unemployed > 15; capital_strike_progress += 1 if unemployed > 24; labor_goal_completed += 1; inflation += 0.1; pro_labor += 1; strike_term_seen += 1; economic_growth -= 0.1;

Our ruling in the Mixed Juries favors union wage claims and employment guarantees. This solidifies our standing among urban and rural workers, but business organizations accuse the government of state interventionism and bias, threatening of capital flight.

@support_employers
subtitle: Popular among the bourgeoisie, much less so among the workers.
on-arrival: besteiristas_dissent += 8; caballeristas_dissent += 8; workers_psoe -= 5 if jurados_mixtos >= 2; rural_psoe -= 5; coalition_dissent -= 1 if in_republican_socialist_conjunction == 1; prr_relation += 5; dlr_relation += 5; workers_pce += 3; pce_coalition_dissent += 1; pce_relation -= 8; capital_strike_progress -= 1 if capital_strike_progress > 1; capital_strike_progress -= 1 if capital_strike_progress > 8; pro_labor -= 1; strike_term_seen += 1

By ruling in favor of the employers, we restore business confidence at the expense of working-class'. Militants within the party accuse us of betraying the socialist movement, driving frustrated workers toward the CNT and PCE.

@balance
subtitle: Both sides need to share the pain in the current crisis.
on-arrival: caballeristas_dissent += 4; workers_psoe -= 2; pce_coalition_dissent += 1; pce_relation -= 5; strike_term_seen += 1

Neither the employers nor the workers leave fully satisfied, but production continues without further escalation.


# options: support the workers in their demands, pushing back against the employers.
# this is the approach favored by the unions. While they do not get everything they desire, an agreement favorable to the workers is reached. The employer associations and their bourgeois allies accuse us of overstepping our bounds.
# try to make some compromise between the sides. Both sides need to share the pain in the current crisis.
# whatever it takes, end the strikes and unrest as soon as possible.
# this is not our business to intervene.
# We are the party of labor, and it is not our business to intervene? There is incredulity in the ranks. The workers are less likely to trust us in the future.
